{
  "email": "{{officerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{officerPass}}"
}

###
@officerToken = {{officerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Bad password — expect 401
POST {{host}}/auth/staff/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "email": "{{staffEmail}}",
  "password": "wrong"
}

