###
###  Applications 
###

# @name submitApp
POST {{host}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "serviceCode": "DRIVING_LICENCE",
  "formData": { "vehicleClass": "B" },
  "documentIds": []
}

###
@applicationId = {{submitApp.response.body.$.id}}

### List my applications
GET {{host}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### List with filter
GET {{host}}/applications?status=SUBMITTED
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Detail
GET {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Department staff: move to UNDER_REVIEW
PATCH {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "UNDER_REVIEW",
  "note": "Received, starting review."
}

### Department staff: request more info (note is required)
PATCH {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "MORE_INFO_NEEDED",
  "note": "Please provide proof of residence."
}

### Citizen responds to a MORE_INFO_NEEDED request
POST {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/respond
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "formData": { "explanation": "Address has not changed." },
  "note": "Same address"
}

### Department staff: approve (requires all required documents to be verified)
PATCH {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "note": "All requirements met."
}

### Department staff: reject (note is required)
PATCH {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "note": "Documents do not match the applicant."
}

### Illegal transition — expect 409
PATCH {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "SUBMITTED"
}


###
###  Documents 
###

### Upload — the field name must be `file`.
# @name uploadDoc
POST {{host}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

NATIONAL_ID
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="id.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/id.pdf
------Boundary--

###
@documentId = {{uploadDoc.response.body.$.id}}

### List my documents
GET {{host}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Attach to an application
POST {{host}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Download as the owner
GET {{host}}/documents/{{documentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Download as department staff (audited)
GET {{host}}/documents/{{documentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Delete an unattached document
DELETE {{host}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}


